      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a good start. the hard part is that the spikes arent always about a single event, sometimes they feel like a massive shift in the overall volatility of a system. like i can feel the whole environment becoming unstable. how would i even quantify that kind of \"environmental tension\" in a dataset so the model doesn't just treat it as noise?",
